    let path: Path<Node> = this; // Local variable, no mutation of `this`
    while (path.parent) {
      path = path.parent;
      yield path;
    }
  }
```
The generator uses a local variable `path`, leaving `this` (the original `Path` instance) immutable. This is the correct pattern for traversal utilities.

